# Copy to .env.local and fill in. The app runs without these (quote form logs
# to the server console); adding them turns on real persistence + notifications.
#
# Two independent notification channels — Floral Launch (the shop: bouquets,
# bouquets, boutonnieres, balloon clusters, graduation leis) is run by Celin
# on her own, so her orders must go to HER email/WhatsApp only, never the
# shared event-decor inbox, and vice versa.

# --- WhatsApp: event decor requests (the whole team) ---
# Uses CallMeBot — a free API for personal WhatsApp notifications (not the
# official WhatsApp Business API, which needs Meta business verification and
# approved message templates; overkill for "ping our own team").
#
# One-time setup per person who should get notified:
#   1. Save +34 644 59 71 67 as a contact on the phone that should be notified.
#   2. From that phone, send it a WhatsApp message: "I allow callmebot to send me messages"
#   3. CallMeBot replies with an apikey. Use it below.
#
# Format: "phone:apikey,phone2:apikey2" — phone = full number with country
# code, no +, no spaces (e.g. 15168080715).
WHATSAPP_NOTIFY_RECIPIENTS=

# --- WhatsApp: Floral Launch shop orders only (Celin) ---
# Same CallMeBot setup as above, but for her number/apikey only.
SHOP_WHATSAPP_RECIPIENTS=

# --- Resend: email on a new EVENT DECOR quote — searchable backup record ---
# https://resend.com/api-keys  — the "from" domain must be verified in Resend
RESEND_API_KEY=
QUOTE_NOTIFY_FROM=Dazzle Designs <hello@yourdomain.com>
QUOTE_NOTIFY_TO=founder1@example.com,founder2@example.com

# --- Resend: Floral Launch shop orders only — goes to Celin's inbox ---
SHOP_NOTIFY_TO=
SHOP_NOTIFY_FROM=Floral Launch by Celin <hello@yourdomain.com>   # optional; falls back to QUOTE_NOTIFY_FROM

# --- Optional: instant team ping (Discord or Slack incoming webhook) ---
TEAM_WEBHOOK_URL=
SHOP_WEBHOOK_URL=

# --- Supabase (persist quote requests) — optional, not required for launch ---
# Project Settings → API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=   # server-only, never expose to the browser
